 "sentences": [
  "An out-of-sync galaxy hides a chaotic secret.",
  "NGC 4698 lies 55 million light-years away in the constellation Virgo.",
  "Its spiral arms hover in a ring-like structure around the perimeter.",
  "A supermassive black hole sits at its center.",
  "Its starry bulge extends out from the disk at a right angle.",
  "The stars and gas nearest the center rotate perpendicular to the rest of the disk."
